    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Cry against Injustice"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: “Do Not Destroy.” A Miktam of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do you really speak righteously, you mighty ones?",
          "Do you judge people fairly?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "No, you practice injustice in your hearts;",
          "with your hands you weigh out violence in the land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The wicked go astray from the womb;",
          "liars wander about from birth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They have venom like the venom of a snake,",
          "like the deaf cobra that stops up its ears,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "that does not listen to the sound of the charmers",
          "who skillfully weave spells."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, knock the teeth out of their mouths;",
          "Lord, tear out the young lions’ fangs."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "May they vanish like water that flows by;",
          "may they aim their blunted arrows. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Like a slug that moves along in slime,",
          "like a woman’s miscarried child,",
          "may they not see the sun."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Before your pots can feel the heat of the thorns —",
          "whether green or burning —",
          "he will sweep them away. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The righteous one will rejoice",
          "when he sees the retribution;",
          "he will wash his feet in the blood of the wicked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then people will say,",
          "“Yes, there is a reward for the righteous!",
          "There is a God who judges on earth! ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
